This PR overly complicates the implementation. 

No need to have this two variables. 
```
model_registry: ${{ vars.AGENT_MODEL_REGISTRY || 'auto' }}
model_registry_url: ${{ vars.AGENT_MODEL_REGISTRY_URL || '' }}
```

1. We should check the github url by default; if not working then fall back?
